{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_03_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_03",
  "title": "往昔",
  "storyCode": "RI-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "afab045af95396763f0972e8ef91c539978dd1df2cd11bb1b33d6f33df44e60c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "text": "這個怪胎好厲害！已經打退了好幾個人了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "text": "雖然聽不懂她在說什麼，但是好強啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
      "text": "讓她來做大酋長感覺好像也不壞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "......嘉維爾，你的同伴好厲害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "雖然這種時候只會讓人傷腦筋就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "不過總算稍微消停了，我上去制住她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "什麼，整合運動，你們又來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "原來是你們搶走了博士嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "別跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "糟了，這傻孩子要跑了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "我去追！特米米，你和博士不要亂動，我會回來找你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "誒，好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "啊，上面又有新的人打起來了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "......博士，可不可以告訴我，嘉維爾在外面是什麼樣的？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "告訴她嘉維爾在羅德島的生活。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "嘉維爾在外面生活得很好嗎。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "難道說你和嘉維爾也不是很熟嗎？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "太好了！......啊，不，我只是以為你和嘉維爾一起回來的，嘉維爾好像很喜歡你的樣子，就以為你和嘉維爾關係很好。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "沒關係的，嘉維爾人很好的，你一定可以和她打好關係的！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "告訴她嘉維爾當醫生的樣子。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "太好了，果然即使成為了醫生，嘉維爾始終是嘉維爾呢！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "是這樣啊，嘉維爾沒有變呀，太好了......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "那如果嘉維爾要離開你的話，你會怎麼想？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "會很難過吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "嗯，果然呢，我當時也哭的很傷心呢......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "你、你怎麼可以這樣！嘉維爾那麼好，她要離開你你怎麼可以覺得無所謂！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "祝賀她找到新的道路吧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "你真厲害......我做不到。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "我一直希望嘉維爾能夠回來。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "博士，那個，在嘉維爾的事情上，我、我是不會輸給你的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "加油。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（點頭）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我也不會輸給你的！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以那一次祭典的結果呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "那一次......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "什麼嘛，你們這幫大人也不過如此嘛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "還有誰要來挑戰我！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "text": "居然把這麼多大人給打倒了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
          "text": "嘉維爾，了不起啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
          "text": "難道說嘉維爾真的能當上大酋長？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "我來！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "什麼啊，怎麼是你，祖瑪瑪。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "你不是造你的機器去了嗎？我去找你你都不理我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "祖瑪瑪",
          "text": "......我想最後試一試。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "試什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "祖瑪瑪",
          "text": "試試我的拳頭能不能打敗你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "你怎麼說得好像要死了一樣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "祖瑪瑪",
          "text": "少廢話，今天我可不會輸給你，嘉維爾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嘿，那要打過才知道了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "她們從中午一直打到了晚上都沒有分出勝負。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "到最後，她們兩個人都沒力氣了，被其他人給丟了下去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "這就是嘉維爾第一次參加祭典的情況了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "祖瑪瑪是個什麼樣的人？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "祖瑪瑪是當時離得比較近的另一個部族的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "小時候，她和嘉維爾經常在一起打架，嘉維爾比她厲害，但祖瑪瑪也不是沒有贏過。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "但是我聽嘉維爾說，她有一天不知道怎麼的，就不再喜歡打架了，開始喜歡研究機器。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "我記得那天，是祖瑪瑪最後一次和嘉維爾打架。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "在那之後，祖瑪瑪就再也沒和嘉維爾打過，甚至很少出現在大家面前，再之後，她的部族就搬走了，我就再也沒見過她了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "就連嘉維爾離開那次的大鬧祭典都沒有來。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我回來了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嘉維爾，你沒事吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我沒事。嘖，小刻這孩子真能跑，一下子就跑沒影了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "不過以她的能力應該不用擔心。特米米，祖瑪瑪來了嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "還沒有。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
          "text": "還有誰要來挑戰！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "我來。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嗯？看來我回來的正是時候。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
